  "body_html": "<h1>dominant_coords_tend_to_zero</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma dominant_coords_tend_to_zero (f : stdSimplex ℝ (Fin n) → stdSimplex ℝ (Fin n)) (C : Finset (Fin n)) (g : ℕ ↪o ℕ) (h_const : ∀ l', (room_seq f (g l')).1.2 = C) : ∀ i ∉ C, Filter.Tendsto (fun l' =&gt; ((room_point_seq f (g l')) : stdSimplex ℝ (Fin n)).1 i) Filter.atTop (𝓝 0)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>room_seq</li>\n<li>room_point_seq</li>\n<li>pick_colorful_point</li>\n<li>isDominant</li>\n<li>TT</li>\n<li>size_bound_out</li>\n<li>TTtostdSimplex</li>\n</ul>",
